  "details": "There is currently no way to control VRChat's blinking behavior.\n\nBlinking blend shapes can distort facial expressions when combined with gestures that affect the same vertices. Blinking by itself only happens in split second intervals, but the blink and lower lid blend shapes are also used to control the upper and lower eyelids whenever the eye tracking behavior looks up or down, which can more frequently look ugly when combined with gesture overrides.",
